{"title": "Magic Initiate: Druid", "pageid": 14493, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp/300px-Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp, /w/images/c/c6/Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp/300px-Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Magic_Initiate_Druid.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Magic Initiate: Druid</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. It grants you spells and cantrips from that particular class.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have learnt 2 cantrips and a Level 1 spell from the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Druid_spells\" title=\"List of Druid spells\">Druid spell list</a>. \n</p><p>You can cast the Level 1 spell once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. Your <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting Modifier\">Spellcasting Modifier</a> for all 3 spells is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/38px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/50px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid (Feat)\">Magic Initiate: Druid (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 647/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3523/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2064/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 696961/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.480      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   28.480      1 -total\n 32.60%    9.285      1 Template:Ability\n 31.21%    8.890      1 Template:Icon_link\n 30.05%    8.559      1 Template:Icon_text\n 26.30%    7.491      2 Template:Trim\n 23.05%    6.564      1 Template:Ifempty\n 15.50%    4.414      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.44%    4.112      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.77%    3.922      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcac